      love: ['yes', 'The film ends with two friends reunited on a beach: friendship is what saves Red.', 'I hope to see my friend and shake his hand.'],
      change: ['thin', 'Kind of: Red chooses a new life, but the scene is about hope and freedom.'],
      conform: ['yes', 'Red breaks parole, the last rule holding him, and chooses the life Andy offers over the one he was told to live.'],
